WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.800
[Instrumental music]
Life on repeat? Wake. Work. Scroll. Same again.

00:04.800 --> 00:08.500
Take a new turn. A little curiosity goes a long way.

00:08.500 --> 00:11.100
Stay in. Go out. Pick your kind of adventure.

00:11.100 --> 00:14.000
Try something. Explore things to do — wherever you are.

00:14.000 --> 00:19.000
Your Bucket list: from someday to done.
Save a quest. Or create your own.

00:19.000 --> 00:24.000
Do the thing. Get the XP.
Experience points. Real experiences.

00:24.000 --> 00:29.500
Taste a bigger world. Discover cuisines. Collect experiences.

00:29.500 --> 00:34.000
Experiences become achievements.
Make memories. Mark milestones.

00:34.000 --> 00:37.000
Make life a little more legendary.

00:37.000 --> 00:40.000
A new way to play your life. Coming soon.
A little curiosity. A lot more life.
